<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-030> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-030 — unilocular Lagena vs Ch. V Delaunay catalogue (Pass 1) (Lagena spp. and monothalamic Foraminifera (Fissurina, Oolina, Procerolagena))",
        "Thompson (1917) T1917-030 — unilocular Lagena vs Ch. V Delaunay catalogue (Pass 1) faithfully reproduces Lagena spp. and monothalamic Foraminifera (Fissurina, Oolina, Procerolagena) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/thompson1917-t1917-030-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/thompson1917-t1917-030-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/thompson1917-t1917-030-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/thompson1917-t1917-030-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/thompson1917-t1917-030-5>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/thompson1917-t1917-030-6> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) thompson/claims/t1917-030_the-spiral-shells-of-the-foraminifera.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Lagena spp. and monothalamic Foraminifera (Fissurina, Oolina, Procerolagena) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/thompson/claims/t1917-030_the-spiral-shells-of-the-foraminifera.py> ;
    schema:about "Lagena spp. and monothalamic Foraminifera (Fissurina, Oolina, Procerolagena)" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: No spiral-coiling chamber series fit; no molecular biomineralisation mechanism",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Pass 1 meridian fit to Fig. 84 + Fig. 19 only; fixed RMSE gate",
        "reported_in_source: Thompson (1917) Ch. XII with Ch. V: monothalamic Lagena as unduloid/flask surfaces before spiral coiling" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/thompson/claims/t1917-030_the-spiral-shells-of-the-foraminifera.py; output: docs/media/t1917_030_the_spiral_shells_of_the_foram_comparison.png; organism: Lagena spp. and monothalamic Foraminifera (Fissurina, Oolina, Procerolagena); environment: python 3.12, numpy 2.x, scipy 1.x, matplotlib 3.x, Pillow 10+; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Thompson (1917) Ch. XII with Ch. V: monothalamic Lagena as unduloid/flask surfaces before spiral coiling; reconstructed_in_script: Pass 1 meridian fit to Fig. 84 + Fig. 19 only; fixed RMSE gate; does_not_claim: No spiral-coiling chamber series fit; no molecular biomineralisation mechanism]" ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-030-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-030-model-fidelity>,
