<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-030-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-030 — unilocular Lagena vs Ch. V Delaunay catalogue (Pass 1) — MorphoEval overall 62.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-31"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 implements the Delaunay catalogue fitter with Fig. 84 and Kireenko Fig. 19 but uses a fixed 0.06 gate only (no free-form floor, ablation, or full sweep export). Overall 62.2/100 (faithfulness 56.1, reproducibility 76.4); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 35d30f4cf; environment: python 3.12, numpy 2.x, scipy 1.x, matplotlib 3.x, Pillow 10+. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 72, Morphological realism / specimen match 58, Parameter expressivity 38, Morphometric validation 44, Source and data traceability 86, Code-to-model traceability 74, Reproducibility package 70. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_030_the_spiral_shells_of_the_foram_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-030_the-spiral-shells-of-the-foraminifera.py at 35d30f4cf, image/png, 1410938 B, 2200×2000 px, artifact_sha256 4e3e73d537f178753cc5dc73406808a3bcfe02c981f814d9b40f0035f60164df (sha256 4e3e73d537f178753cc5dc73406808a3bcfe02c981f814d9b40f0035f60164df), spec_fingerprint b34282bb5042ed2c7e96a316685b10531cd3439cb7059e3c291735bdd26880b9. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: b34282bb5042ed2c7e96a316685b10531cd3439cb7059e3c291735bdd26880b9; artifact_sha256: 4e3e73d537f178753cc5dc73406808a3bcfe02c981f814d9b40f0035f60164df; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-030/kireenko_2022_bdj_e87457_fig8_station5656mc.jpg=3b57acc0dfc98374..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-030/paper_citations.bib=102e5d153f118cc9..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-030/scout_manifest.json=dfb385784d2f08b9..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-030/thompson_1917_fig84_lagena_after_brady.png=f6cd3abb75217bd0..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-030/thompson_1917_leaf0276_p256_fig84.jp2=ed440583a8b144d5...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Thompson (1917) Ch. XII with Ch. V: monothalamic Lagena as unduloid/flask surfaces before spiral coiling; reconstructed_in_script: Pass 1 meridian fit to Fig. 84 + Fig. 19 only; fixed RMSE gate; does_not_claim: No spiral-coiling chamber series fit; no molecular biomineralisation mechanism." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'Pass 2: adaptive free-form floor gate, ellipsoid/sphere-cylinder ablation, full parameter sweep, Fig. 8 controls, KS/CV export'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Document Pass 1 vs Pass 2 metrics separately in audit measurements'}" ;
    pk:hasScore 6.22e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

